{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_curse_mark","model_identifier":"spell_curse_mark","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_curse_mark\n\nCurse mark: a dark violet sigil, a broken ring with a hollow crown shape inside (12 u across), hanging above a cursed unit's head. Origin at the sigil centre; place it about 74 u up. Faces -Z (the game may billboard it).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -6..6, y -6..6, z -0..0 units (0.37 x 0.37 x 0.03 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 16, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 17.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 13 x 13 x 1 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `loop` | 3.0 | loop | slow bob and a lazy wobble |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_crown0, glow_crown1, glow_crown2, glow_crown3, glow_crown4, glow_crown5, glow_crown6, glow_ring0, glow_ring1, glow_ring10, glow_ring11, glow_ring3 ...\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":16},"elements":[{"name":"glow_ring0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.7,5.3,-0.5],"to":[1.7,6.5,0.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8.3,5.5,11.7,6.7],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.5,7.5,1.5,8.7],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[8.3,5.5,11.7,6.7],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.5,7.5,1.5,8.7],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[12.3,5.5,15.7,6.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[12.3,5.5,15.7,6.5],"texture":0}},"ty